{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2021-05", "window": 4, "start_date": 1621814400, "end_date": 1622505599, "month_true_total": 104, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 18:00:17 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "92954033", "author": {"steamid": "76561198007217303", "personaname": "Patman", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198007217303/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 46, "playtime_forever": 327, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 302, "last_played": 1623450062, "avatar": "3954395a2d2ba63ae7886c3dc9ffd04c9eac089d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Old gold.", "timestamp_created": 1622491531, "timestamp_updated": 1622491531, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "92914816", "author": {"steamid": "76561198107558384", "personaname": "AIIGoodThings", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198107558384/", "num_games_owned": 147, "num_reviews": 30, "playtime_forever": 543, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 543, "last_played": 1622438490, "avatar": "a2559a3f7f142a5538dde95ff06abda5cf2395b0"}, "language": "english", "review": "Warhammer 40k Space Marine is my second Warhammer experience besides watching Astartes. \n\nThe story and voice acting make for an epic narrative in which a trio of juggernaut soldiers quest to save a human planet from extinction, while they try to unravel the mystery of why the planet was selected for invasion. The finer details of Space Marine's campaign are almost lost in the frenetic tedium of travelling a set path, mowing down hoards of melee and ranged enemies for hours.Third person gunplay is well executed and is on par with the most renowned FPS's. Smooth aiming, violent recoil, excellent sound design, and well animated enemy deaths make every weapon feel powerful, but firing the scoped stalker bolter and lasercannon into orc heads is an especially visceral experience.  The normal routine of thinning out the enemy hoard on foot is occaisionally interrupted by overpowered jetpack sections; slamming into a crowd of enemies from the sky with a war hammer was an awesome experience. \n\nWhile I may remember the overall experience as a blend of Call of Duty and Dynasty Warriors, I'm excited to experience more Warhammer and Warhammer 40k content. I would like to know more about the human, orc, and chaos factions within this universe.", "timestamp_created": 1622441355, "timestamp_updated": 1636767897, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.560340940952301025", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "92903976", "author": {"steamid": "76561198127015553", "personaname": "THEAVJ2", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198127015553/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 1299, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 809, "last_played": 1627358603, "avatar": "c84584752e5cf659d24f632df4816490cccb94f1"}, "language": "english", "review": "its the hack and slash one i'm not one for the eagle eye perspective like Xcom or WoW, i want to be immersed, and in the action the campaign is why i bought this game its awesome and if you like curb stomping orks this game is definitely for you. if the online pvp has any players im sure it would be cool", "timestamp_created": 1622422712, "timestamp_updated": 1622422712, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "92896836", "author": {"steamid": "76561198058429654", "personaname": "ℐℎℯ Vladimir Pootis", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/cptpootisbamf/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 36, "playtime_forever": 1461, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1451, "last_played": 1692415098, "avatar": "24213866da70e91319a4819821aa663bfd752c43"}, "language": "english", "review": "It is better to die for the Emperor than to live for yourself\n\n10/10 guardsman KIA for the glory of the Imperium! Shiv your enemies for health. Amazing.", "timestamp_created": 1622411220, "timestamp_updated": 1622411220, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "92894521", "author": {"steamid": "76561198073676996", "personaname": "Cjthemvp123", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198073676996/", "num_games_owned": 266, "num_reviews": 74, "playtime_forever": 569, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 361, "last_played": 1756147199, "avatar": "aeb2a7b251a3a2ac49cbe7072d95d8e08516e1a3"}, "language": "english", "review": "Codex astartes  approved gaming", "timestamp_created": 1622408122, "timestamp_updated": 1622408122, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck